<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLES RESULTS (1800 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLES RESULTS (1800 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Doubles results on the 10th day of</p>
<p>the French Open tennis tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Fourth round:</p>
<p>3-Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands)/Rick Leach (U.S.) beat 7-Brenda</p>
<p>Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands)/Piet Norval (South Africa) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Fourth round:</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)/Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>beat Karsten Braasch/Jens Knippschild (Germany) 4-6 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Fourth round:</p>
<p>8-Alexandra Fusai/Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat 10-Conchita</p>
<p>Martinez (Spain)/Patricia Tarabini (Argentina) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>5-Mary Joe Fernandez/Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat 4-Larisa Neiland</p>
<p>(Latvia)/Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>3-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)/Arantxa Sanchez-Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>beat 7-Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia)/Caroline Vis (Netherlands) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 7-5</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 6-Nicole</p>
<p>Arendt (U.S.)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) 7-6 (7-3) 1-6 6-3</p>
<p>(Ends double results)</p>
</text>
